---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="M-GEO Abogados | Estudio Jurídico | ART, Tránsito y Derecho Civil"
  description="Seguridad jurídica. Resultados efectivos. Especialistas en reclamos de ART, accidentes de tránsito, derecho civil y corporativo."
  ogImage="/matias-geo.png"
>
  
  <section class="relative bg-brand-dark text-white min-h-[90vh] md:min-h-screen flex items-center px-6 md:px-12 overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.png')]"></div>
    <div class="hidden md:block absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[40rem] h-[40rem] bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>

    <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-[400px] h-[400px] md:top-1/2 md:-translate-y-1/2 md:right-0 md:w-[80vh] md:h-[80vh] opacity-[0.02] md:opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen transition-all duration-700">
      <img src="/logo-abogados.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl relative z-10 w-full">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-8 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-5 py-2 backdrop-blur-sm max-w-full">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-primary animate-pulse shrink-0"></span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 font-body text-[9px] md:text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-bold whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden text-ellipsis">Unidad Legal de M-GEO</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6.5rem] font-heading font-bold leading-[1.05] mb-8 tracking-tighter">
        Seguridad jurídica. <br />
        <span class="text-3xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[5.5rem] italic font-light text-gray-400">Resultados efectivos<span class="text-brand-primary">.</span></span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-brand-primary pl-6">
        Defendemos tus derechos y protegemos tu patrimonio mediante una estrategia legal precisa y efectiva. Actuamos en conflictos laborales, civiles, comerciales y deportivos.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
        <a href="#contacto" class="bg-brand-primary text-white px-10 py-5 font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[11px] hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-dark transition-all duration-500 w-full sm:w-auto text-center shadow-[0_10px_30px_-10px_rgba(120,22,22,0.5)]">
          Iniciar Consulta
        </a>
        
        <a href="#especialidades" class="text-white hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors font-body font-semibold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] group flex items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto py-4">
          Ver Especialidades <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg>
        </a>

        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-6 bg-white/20"></div>

        <a href="https://instagram.com/mgeo.abogados" target="_blank" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors font-body font-semibold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] group flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto py-4" title="Instagram M-GEO Abogados">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
            <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
            <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.5" y2="6.5"></line>
          </svg>
          @mgeo.abogados
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-white px-6 border-b border-gray-100">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <span class="text-brand-primary font-body font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[10px] md:text-xs mb-4 block">Nuestra Visión</span>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark leading-[1.1] mb-8 tracking-tight">
            Litigamos con firmeza.<br/>
            <span class="italic font-light text-gray-400">Negociamos con inteligencia.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 font-light text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            En derecho, no solo se trata de conocer la ley, sino de aplicarla estratégicamente. Brindamos asesoramiento a particulares y empresas en defensa de sus intereses.
          </p>
          
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark">100%</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 leading-tight">Transparencia<br/>procesal</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="w-12 h-px sm:w-px sm:h-10 bg-gray-200"></div>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-primary">24h</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 leading-tight">Análisis y<br/>Respuesta</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-[#F9F8F6] p-8 md:p-10 border border-gray-100 hover:border-brand-primary/30 transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-primary mb-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 3v1.5M3 21v-6m0 0l2.77-.693a9 9 0 016.208.682l.108.054a9 9 0 006.086.71l3.114-.732a48.524 48.524 0 01-.005-10.499l-3.11.732a9 9 0 01-6.085-.711l-.108-.054a9 9 0 00-6.208-.682L3 4.5M3 15V4.5" /></svg>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Rigor Técnico</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Estudio minucioso de cada caso para no dejar margen al error.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 md:p-10 border border-brand-dark transform sm:translate-y-8 shadow-2xl">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-primary mb-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">Visión Comercial</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Cuidamos la viabilidad económica y financiera de las negociaciones de nuestros clientes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="especialidades" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#F9F8F6] px-6">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-20">
        <span class="text-brand-primary font-body font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[10px] md:text-xs mb-4 block">Nuestras Áreas</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark leading-[1.1] mb-8 tracking-tight">Soluciones Legales Directas.</h2>
        <!-- <p class="text-gray-500 font-light text-base md:text-lg mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Gestión estratégica y enfocada en resultados para empresas y particulares.</p> -->
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        
        <div class="bg-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-100 flex flex-col xl:flex-row overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="xl:w-5/12 bg-brand-dark text-white p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">
                <span class="text-brand-primary">Gestión legal de</span> <br/>
                <span class="text-white italic">Empresas</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Brindamos la mejor estrategia legal en todas las áreas del derecho para proteger el núcleo de tu negocio.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-14 bg-white flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Abonos a Medida</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Planes adaptados a la operatoria y necesidades de cada empresa.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Cobertura Integral</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Gestión extrajudicial y judicial de conflictos legales.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/areas/empresas" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-dark font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] pb-2 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary transition-all duration-300 w-max mt-8">
              <span>Ver más</span> 
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-100 flex flex-col xl:flex-row-reverse overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="xl:w-5/12 bg-[#161616] text-white p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">
                <span class="text-brand-primary">Derecho</span> <br/>
                <span class="text-white italic">Laboral</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Asesoramos a trabajadores y empresas en conflictos laborales, brindando soluciones claras y efectivas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-14 bg-white flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Despidos y Reclamos</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Intervención rápida en todo tipo de situaciones vinculadas a la relación laboral.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Enfoque Estratégico</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Manejo confidencial y orientado 100% a la obtención de resultados.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/areas/laboral" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-dark font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] pb-2 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary transition-all duration-300 w-max mt-8">
              <span>Ver más</span> 
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-100 flex flex-col xl:flex-row overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="xl:w-5/12 bg-brand-dark text-white p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">
                <span class="text-brand-primary">Accidentes</span> <br/>
                <span class="text-white italic">Laborales (ART)</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Nos ocupamos de tramitar la DETERMINACIÓN DE INCAPACIDAD en las Comisiones Médicas de la SRT, y de ser necesarios, los reclamos judiciales.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-brand-primary/10 border-l-2 border-brand-primary p-4">
                <span class="text-brand-primary font-bold text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1 block">Importante</span>
                <p class="text-xs font-light text-gray-200">El reclamo NO es contra tu empleador. Es contra la ART y requiere patrocinio letrado obligatorio.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-14 bg-white flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Trámite en SRT</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Gestión virtual y presencial para establecer el porcentaje de incapacidad.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Cobro de Indemnización</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Audiencias de homologación de acuerdos en SRT o inicio de demanda judicial.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/areas/art" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-dark font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] pb-2 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary transition-all duration-300 w-max mt-8">
              <span>Ver más</span> 
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-100 flex flex-col xl:flex-row-reverse overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="xl:w-5/12 bg-[#161616] text-white p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">
                <span class="text-brand-primary">Accidentes de</span> <br/>
                <span class="text-white italic">Tránsito</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Gestionamos tu reclamo por daños y perjuicios frente a compañías de seguros, buscando la máxima indemnización.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-14 bg-white flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Mediación Prejudicial</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Priorizamos acuerdos extrajudiciales rápidos y efectivos.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Litigio Estratégico</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">De no haber acuerdo, impulsamos la demanda judicial con firmeza.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/areas/transito" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-dark font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] pb-2 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary transition-all duration-300 w-max mt-8">
              <span>Ver más</span> 
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-100 flex flex-col xl:flex-row overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="xl:w-5/12 bg-brand-dark text-white p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">
                <span class="text-brand-primary">Derecho</span> <br/>
                <span class="text-white italic">Sucesorio</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Brindamos asesoramiento y representación en cada etapa de la sucesión, procurando soluciones eficientes que permitan avanzar el trámite con seguridad jurídica, orden y previsibilidad.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-14 bg-white flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Trámite Ágil</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Declaratorias de herederos, inscripción de bienes y acuerdos de partición de herencia.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Tipos de Sucesión</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Intervenimos tanto en procesos <span class="italic">Ab-Intestato</span> como testamentarios.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/areas/sucesiones" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-dark font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] pb-2 border-b border-gray-300 hover:border-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary transition-all duration-300 w-max mt-8">
              <span>Ver más</span> 
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-100 flex flex-col xl:flex-row-reverse overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="xl:w-5/12 bg-[#161616] text-white p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 leading-tight">
                <span class="text-brand-primary">Derecho del</span> <br/>
                <span class="text-white italic">Consumidor</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Representamos a consumidores y/o usuarios y/o Empresas en reclamos de Defensa del Consumidor, buscando soluciones rápidas y efectivas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-14 bg-white flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Extrajudicial</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Promovemos acuerdos rápidos y efectivos.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-sm">
                <h4 class="text-brand-dark font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Judicial</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">Litigamos con firmeza en defensa de tus intereses.</p>
              </div>
